# Training environment: GPU pod only (H100, CUDA 12.x).
# Resolved on the pod with `uv pip compile` into requirements/train.txt.
# Source of truth for library choice: Unsloth Qwen3.5 fine-tune guide
# (https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/qwen3.5/fine-tune) which requires
# transformers v5 for Qwen3.5 and recommends bf16 LoRA (not 4-bit QLoRA).

unsloth
